---
// Componente interactivo de benchmarking internacional respaldado por Stanford
---

<div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/90 shadow-sm p-4 sm:p-8 lg:p-10 transition-all">
  <!-- Stanford Professor Quote Header -->
  <div class="stanford-quote-box bg-slate-950 text-white rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl p-5 sm:p-8 lg:p-10 border border-slate-800 shadow-xl mb-8 sm:mb-10 relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute -right-10 -bottom-10 w-60 h-60 bg-amber-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-4xl space-y-4">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300 border border-amber-500/30 text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-widest">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-400 animate-ping shrink-0"></span>
        <i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap text-amber-400"></i> Dictamen Científico Independiente
      </div>

      <blockquote class="text-lg sm:text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white leading-snug tracking-tight">
        «Borboyona es un <span class="monstruo-potencial-shimmer font-black">monstruo potencial</span>. Comparte con exactitud los mismos controles geológicos y estructurales que el gigante Antamina.»
      </blockquote>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 sm:gap-4 pt-2 border-t border-slate-800">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 sm:w-12 sm:h-12 rounded-full bg-amber-500/20 border border-amber-500/40 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-amber-300 text-xs sm:text-sm shrink-0">
          ME
        </div>
        <div>
          <h5 class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-white">Dr. Marco Einaudi</h5>
          <p class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs text-slate-400">Profesor Emérito de Geología Económica, Universidad de Stanford (Agosto 2020)</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Benchmarking Cards Grid -->
  <div class="mb-6">
    <h4 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-1 sm:mb-2">
      Estudio Comparativo con los 3 Gigantes Mineros del Mundo
    </h4>
    <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600">
      Análisis técnico de escala geológica, tipo de yacimiento y reservas frente a las operaciones más rentables de la historia:
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 sm:gap-6">
    <!-- Antamina -->
    <div class="bg-white rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-7 border border-slate-200 shadow-xs card-hover flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
          <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest font-extrabold text-amber-600 bg-amber-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-amber-200">
            Perú (Glencore/BHP/Teck)
          </span>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-mountain-sun text-slate-400"></i>
        </div>
        <h5 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">Mina Antamina</h5>
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 block mb-3">Modelo Skarn Polimetálico</span>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Borboyona replica el sistema metasomático alojado en secuencias carbonatadas intrudidas por fases ígneas calco-alcalinas de gran escala, idénticas a los cuerpos minerales de Antamina en Áncash.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex justify-between items-center text-xs">
        <span class="text-slate-500">Paralelismo Geológico:</span>
        <span class="font-bold text-slate-900">Skarn Cu-Zn-Ag-Pb</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bingham Canyon -->
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-7 border border-slate-200 shadow-xs card-hover flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
          <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest font-extrabold text-blue-600 bg-blue-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-blue-200">
            Utah, EE. UU. (Rio Tinto)
          </span>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-compass-drafting text-slate-400"></i>
        </div>
        <h5 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">Bingham Canyon District</h5>
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 block mb-3">Pórfido + Aureolas Polimetálicas</span>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Estructura geológica idéntica: núcleo de pórfido de cobre central de alta ley rodeado de mantos y aureolas ricas en plomo, plata y zinc, replicando los depósitos históricos de Apex y Highland Boy en Utah.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex justify-between items-center text-xs">
        <span class="text-slate-500">Aureolas Periféricas:</span>
        <span class="font-bold text-slate-900">Ricas en Ag-Pb-Zn</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- La Escondida -->
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-7 border border-slate-200 shadow-xs card-hover flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
          <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest font-extrabold text-emerald-600 bg-emerald-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-emerald-200">
            Chile (BHP / Rio Tinto)
          </span>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-column text-slate-400"></i>
        </div>
        <h5 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">Mina La Escondida</h5>
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 block mb-3">Envergadura de Tonelaje</span>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Frente al déficit global de nuevos descubrimientos, Borboyona es una de las poquísimas propiedades 100% privadas en el mundo con potencial documentado para superar los <strong>3,000 millones de toneladas (3.01 BT)</strong>.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex justify-between items-center text-xs">
        <span class="text-slate-500">Potencial de Escala:</span>
        <span class="font-bold text-emerald-600">+3,000M Toneladas</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .stanford-quote-box {
    animation: stanfordAuraPulse 4s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes stanfordAuraPulse {
    0%, 100% {
      border-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6), 0 0 0 0 rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.1);
    }
    50% {
      border-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.5);
      box-shadow: 0 16px 36px -4px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7), 0 0 24px 2px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.18);
    }
  }

  .monstruo-potencial-shimmer {
    background: linear-gradient(
      90deg,
      #fef08a 0%,
      #f59e0b 25%,
      #ffffff 50%,
      #f59e0b 75%,
      #fef08a 100%
    );
    background-size: 200% auto;
    color: transparent;
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    animation: goldTextShine 4s linear infinite;
  }
  @keyframes goldTextShine {
    to {
      background-position: 200% center;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .stanford-quote-box,
    .monstruo-potencial-shimmer {
      animation: none !important;
    }
  }
</style>
